setPositionFee.t.sol
├── when caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with {OwnableUnauthorizedAccount} error
└── when caller is the owner
    ├── when the new position fee is zero
    │   └── it should revert with {PERPEX__INVALID_POSITION_FEE} error
    └── when the new position fee is not zero
        ├── it should update the position fee
        └── it should emit the {PositionFeeUpdated} event
